Suggests: default-mta | mail-transport-agent
Description: safety-oriented local media hot cache for Jellyfin
 Jellyfin Hotcache promotes selected media files from slower storage to a
 faster local cache while preserving Jellyfin's original media paths.
 .
 It includes playback-aware promotion and demotion, PostgreSQL and SQLite
 playback-history support, active-stream protection, preserved source
 originals, manifest tracking, locking, and a read-only preflight mode.
